:{"text":"Charlotte's injury list keeps growing: Dennis Schroder is out at least two weeks, Kon Knueppel at least four, and Brandon Miller has a hip strain. Charles Lee is reviewing the offseason routine while insisting there are \"no excuses\". Grayson Allen and Royce O'Neale face Phoenix for the first time since the June trade that sent Miles Bridges to the Suns, so expect extra edge in that matchup. Phoenix are smarting from a 26-point loss in San Antonio and Jordan Ott's call for more support for Devin Booker. The lean goes to Phoenix.","sources":["https://www.hoopsrumors.com/2026/11/hornets-knueppel-schroder-out-multiple-weeks-with-hamstring-strains.html","https://www.hoopsrumors.com/2026/11/hornets-notes-injuries-miller-knueppel-williams-offseason.html","https://roundtable.io/sports/nba/suns/news/suns-winning-streak-is-about-to-face-the-ultimate-reality-check","https://clutchpoints.com/nba/phoenix-suns/suns-news-miles-bridges-knows-what-phoenix-must-do-squandering-devin-booker-big-game-spurs-loss"],"written_at":"2026-11-11T06:44:07Z"},"odds":null,"odds_books":null},"odds_first":null,"odds_last":null,"books_first":null,"books_last":null,"first_made_at":"2026-11-09T11:14:30.508255+00:00"}